#
# The `file` module from inside a cask's page. Every task is one command over the bridge to the cask, which
# runs the same public task in the env that is native there. The command name is the public module, an
# underscore, the public task, with hyphens as underscores. An opaque handle stays in the cask and crosses as its
# id, which the page keeps in the form's private field. Internal: reached only through the public file API.

dock load
  load <global:bridge>, name bridge

load @term/base/json
  find make-object
  find set-field
  find from-text
  find from-boolean
  find from-number
  find make-null
  find as-text
  find as-boolean
